'''''Devising Stratagems''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Head to the Palace of Astrum and meet with Yukong
# Discuss your conclusions with Welt
# Meet with Tingyun
# Go with Tingyun to the Petrichor Inn
# Chat with Welt and March 7th

