;(Talk to Listen)
:'''Emotional Man:''' That Starwatcher Avenue would be so crowded even with a lockdown... Xianzhou is really a sight to behold.
:'''Melancholic Woman:''' It's a pity that we can only admire from afar.
:'''Emotional Man:''' It's all right, it will get better very soon. I'll treat you to a meal when the lockdown is lifted.
:'''Melancholic Woman:''' *sigh* I certainly hope so.

;(Talk to Listen)
:'''Salary-Concerned Freight Handler:''' *sigh* The dock's been sealed off. Will we be getting our wages?
:'''Livelihood-Concerned Freight Handler:''' No idea. I doubt it. The boss probably has no money to pay us, what with this fiasco...
:'''Salary-Concerned Freight Handler:''' If this keeps up, how'll we survive then?
:'''Livelihood-Concerned Freight Handler:''' Who knows... *sigh* I wonder when the restrictions will be lifted...
:'''Navigation Officer:''' Yes, Madam.
:'''Yukong:''' Report the losses to General Jing Yuan and find someone from the Divination Commission. They can't just stand there watching while we deal with this mess...
:'''Yukong:''' Greetings, guests from the Astral Express.
:'''Yukong:''' Tingyun has informed me of the purpose of your visit. Receiving guests isn't normally one of my responsibilities...
:'''Yukong:''' ...but since you know about the Stellaron and have stated that you want to help the Luofu, I thought I should at least meet you in person...
:'''Yukong:''' ...and politely decline your proposal.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Decline!?
::Decline!?
::Why!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why!?
::Decline!?
::Why!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
::...
::'''Yukong:''' The Xianzhou Alliance knows what a Stellaron is and is more than capable of handling it ourselves. We have been around for over 8000 years and weathered countless dangers and crises. While the situation is serious, we have more than enough resources to spare. Outsider help is not needed on this occasion.
::'''Yukong:''' You are guests from afar &mdash; there is no reason for this matter to concern you... Am I making myself clear?
::'''Welt:''' From what we've gathered, the influence of the Stellaron can still be contained.
::'''Welt:''' If we can locate it in time and contain it, it's possible that we can restore any space &mdash; and any individuals &mdash; affected by the corrosion.
::'''Welt:''' We have experience in preventing Stellaron disasters, and we've only come here to lend you that experience.
::'''Yukong:''' I've said this and I'll say it again: This is an internal affair of the Xianzhou Alliance and there is no need for the Astral Express to get involved. I decided to arrange a meeting with you as a gesture of respect, but my decision is final.
::'''Welt:''' ...But&mdash;
::'''March 7th:''' Never mind, Mr. Yang. If the Xianzhou Alliance say they can handle it, then we're wasting our breath. Let's go.
::'''Yukong:''' I'm afraid that's impossible.
::'''March 7th:''' ...Huh? And what's that supposed to mean?
::'''Yukong:''' It's only been a few days since the presence of a Stellaron was detected on the Luofu. Starskiff Haven has been under full lockdown &mdash; no one has been permitted to leave. How did you come to know of the incident, and what led you to conclude that it was linked to a Stellaron?
::'''Yukong:''' I acquired the access history of Starskiff Haven. Not long ago, someone hacked into the system and opened the Jade Gate, before guiding you, the Astral Express, into our territory.
::'''Yukong:''' The hacker was skillful and even taunted us with her seal. Her name is Silver Wolf, a member of the Stellaron Hunters...
::'''Yukong:''' What say you in your defense?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Stellaron Hunters told us to come here!
:::The Stellaron Hunters told us to come here!
:::The Stellaron Hunters want to use you to take us out!
:::'''Yukong:''' You are forbidden from leaving the Sky-Faring Commission until the aforementioned questions have been investigated.
